715
02:05:23,703 --> 02:05:26,943
Long Term MVC Core.net Core.

716
02:05:28,644 --> 02:05:29,404
Tamam.

717
02:05:30,064 --> 02:05:31,064
Create diyelim.

718
02:05:36,884 --> 02:05:37,463
